@Data Engineering, can you drop the impacted rows and source mappings today against http://sharepoint/aml_(anti-money_laundering)_project/sar_reporting_requirements_spec?  

@Legal and @Ops, can you give a clean yes/no on the updated interpretation by EOD? If either says no, should we treat that as a named gap and keep the scope open?

