For the provisional low-risk gaps, let’s keep them visible in the same cycle with owner and review date, but no blocker status unless routing, thresholds, or escalation change.  
@Legal/@Risk, can you tag the critical rows by Friday against http://sharepoint/aml_(anti-money_laundering)_project/risk:_incomplete_regulatory_coverage_spec, and @Ops please keep the holding lane clean so we can freeze the must-lock list?

