@Vendor, post timing impacts, test cases, and ERP/reporting cutoffs in http://sharepoint/treasury_management_system_implementation/risk:_vendor_integration_complexity_spec by Friday; @Architecture, confirm whether any missed-window handling needs a separate exception path.  
Can we lock the blocker call now so Finance and Support aren’t left cleaning up UAT surprises later?

